            <ArticleTitle>Ventricular free wall and septal rupture (double rupture): a &quot;pseudocomplication&quot; during post-infarction laser angioplasty.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>147-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report the rare occurrence of double rupture of the myocardium occurring immediately following successful laser recanalization of an occluded right coronary artery in a 72-year-old woman 5 days following infero-posterior myocardial infarction.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
